Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.62,0:00:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.03,0:00:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready as I'll ever be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A couple reminders before I log you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're using Super User Account 01,\NStacia, the Goddess of Creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have admin privileges that include\Nunlimited manipulation of the landscape.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But be careful with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.34,0:00:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you change the terrain,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.74,0:00:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the flow of the mnemonic\Ndata between your STL and the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Underworld's main visualizer\Nis going to be massive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.64,0:00:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking overloading\Nyour Fluctlight massive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be fine if you change\Nthe terrain up a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just try not to overdo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.28,0:00:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll know you are if\Nyour head starts hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:00:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it does, stop. Got it? Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.22,0:00:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:00:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's up to you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.46,0:00:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you in a bit.
