Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I overdid it on the first try.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.28,0:03:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever, now that I'm\Nhere, I have to find Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Stacia?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.38,0:03:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The goddess, Stacia?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.98,0:03:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.10,0:03:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely not a goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.10,0:03:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you, I mean, you\Njust performed a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.40,0:03:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone owes you their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.44,0:03:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved the guards and the priest\Nand me and my mentor, Kirito, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.06,0:03:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, Kirito is the reason I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.74,0:03:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to see him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.78,0:03:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So please, take me to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.58,0:03:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know he's not well,\Nbut I think I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.40,0:03:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let me see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.74,0:03:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.65,0:03:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.94,0:04:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's alright, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.50,0:04:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.98,0:04:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you both, for keeping him\Nsafe and letting me see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.30,0:04:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, if you're not Lady\NStacia, then who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.72,0:05:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.48,0:05:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm human, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.86,0:05:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I come from the same place as Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.50,0:05:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And neither is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.20,0:05:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what world?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.92,0:05:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only other one is Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.12,0:05:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that where you're from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.58,0:05:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The home of the three\Ngoddesses of creation?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.18,0:05:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The gods who control the\Nelements and the angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.28,0:05:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He and I aren't from heaven\Nor any place like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.90,0:05:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of complicated to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.52,0:05:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the best thing would be for me\Nto talk to whoever's in charge here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.36,0:05:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you take me to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.06,0:05:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.32,0:05:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take you right to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.62,0:05:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.54,0:05:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back. Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll figure this out somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.04,0:06:06.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.95,0:06:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She means no harm, m 'lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.78,0:06:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.12,0:06:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's here to help, Lady Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.26,0:06:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.08,0:06:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want with Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.82,0:06:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back off, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.06,0:06:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito is mine, understand? Ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.02,0:06:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be gone from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.80,0:06:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.08,0:06:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that is a heck of a sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.10,0:06:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two beautiful flowers in bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why do you stop me uncle do not trust her\Nshe is a spy for the enemy would you relax
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kiddo she's definitely not working for the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bad guys didn't you see\Nwhat happened out there
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.66,0:07:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she saved everyone's lives
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,including mine
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.34,0:07:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here they come
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.88,0:07:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This rainbow appeared when it hit the\Nground. It cracked it open for a hundred
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.58,0:07:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,miles it made a gap so wide those pugilists\Ncouldn't even jump it we were this close
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To being wiped out and she stopped it.\NThere's no denying that we owe this lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.98,0:07:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our thanks what are you implying she is\Neither an enemy spy or some filthy heretic
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,posing as a divine entity but there is\Nno way she is the goddess stacia didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.72,0:07:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,say she was think about it if this little\Nlady was a real goddess she'd be scarier
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.26,0:08:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than the pontifex she'd break you in half\Nfor being rude to her then she'd chuck
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.06,0:08:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your ass into that pit she conjured
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,true
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.66,0:08:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i may look it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but i'm not a goddess
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.44,0:08:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm a human being just like\Nyou that said i am from
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.56,0:08:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,another world and i know\Nthings about your situation
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.00,0:08:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you don't we should hear\Nher out in fact the other
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knights in the unit captains\Nshould be part of this we
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.60,0:08:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can discuss it over some\Ntea right as you wish great
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now that that's settled i\Nneed your help ladies get
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some tea and some booze for\Nme and bring it back to my
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.32,0:08:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tent you might as well stay\Nfor the meeting too yes sir
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me be clear
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.42,0:09:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you would like to see Kirito,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must ask my permission first\NHis safety is my responsibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,regardless of who you are
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.48,0:09:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That does it I don't need\Nyour permission to see
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not yours. Perhaps\Nhe should decide that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.02,0:09:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, perhaps he should
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's all we needed,\Nmore tension. Oh wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time to go and boil some water You start\Nthat, and I'll get the liquor jug, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.96,0:09:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.26,0:09:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Kitty Toe's my mentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you all?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.76,0:09:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Asuna, and I come\Nfrom a world outside yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.98,0:09:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A human world, but you\Ncan't physically get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.94,0:09:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My home, the real world, and yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.28,0:10:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the underworld, are two totally\Nseparate planes of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.54,0:10:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As we speak, there's a battle\Ngoing on in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.38,0:10:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's between two groups, and they're both\Nfighting for control of the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.04,0:10:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here on behalf of one of the groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.32,0:10:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're called Wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that why you're here, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.56,0:10:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To take over our world and rule over it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.26,0:10:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.64,0:10:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My group and I, we want\Nto protect the Underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people we're fighting against\Ndon't care about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just want one of your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when they find them, they'll capture\Nthem and bring them into our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, destroy yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.36,0:10:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's monstrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.52,0:10:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.98,0:10:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we know she speaks the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.36,0:10:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dark Territory\Nsurrounds the Human Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.36,0:10:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's basically a whole\Nnother world from ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A place with folks who just want to\Ninvade and destroy us few of us have
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.70,0:10:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ever seen it or been To it but it's\Nas real as our side of the mountains
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.90,0:11:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now we find out there's another\NWorld out there I say sure why not
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.32,0:11:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you said these folks you're fighting\Nare looking for someone specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got any idea who that could be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.94,0:11:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.40,0:11:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's what this Priestess\Nof Light stuff's about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.10,0:11:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, there isn't much time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.62,0:11:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one way to\Nkeep the Underworld safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that's for Alice to return to\Nthe real world with me as quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.56,0:11:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the enemy finds out she's not here,\Nthey'll give up and leave your world alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.86,0:11:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.58,0:11:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to run away to\Nyour so-called real world?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To abandon my people when\Nthey need me the most?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.78,0:11:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would never!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.96,0:11:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am an Integrity Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.14,0:11:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My one and only duty is to\Nprotect the human empire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.58,0:11:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you'd be doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.42,0:11:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish there were another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.48,0:12:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the enemy from the real\Nworld finds you, they'll take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.12,0:12:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then everything here, the people,\Nthe land, the sky, everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.44,0:12:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they will erase it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to go right now before\Nthey find you. Hold on there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.32,0:12:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems your information's a\Nbit out of date, little lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy from your world?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.56,0:12:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they already found her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.56,0:12:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything makes a lot more sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.00,0:12:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all fits the Priestess of\NLight and the Dark God Vecta.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.84,0:12:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why he suddenly\Nshowed up to lead his army.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.62,0:12:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's not a Dark God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.50,0:12:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He came from the real world just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.54,0:12:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dark God Vecta.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.66,0:12:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the Dark Territory has superuser\Naccounts, and they're not locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, may I ask something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.10,0:12:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regarding this Priestess of Light,\NI have never heard of her before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.08,0:12:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why do these invaders from the real\Nworld want Alice of all people so badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.38,0:12:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She broke the seal in her right eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.46,0:13:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know of what happened?\NAnd the seal? But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The central cathedral is indestructible,\Nmade of the hardest material here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.48,0:13:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think how fun it would\Nbe to slice through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.24,0:13:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then all of a sudden, I feel a\Nhorrible pain in my right eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.12,0:13:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how many of us here\Nexperienced the same thing as her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.14,0:13:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure at some point you all had doubts
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.20,0:13:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about the Pontifex or\Nsome of the Church's laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.38,0:13:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw flashes of red light in your\Nright eye, and then you felt the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.20,0:13:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hurt so bad it made you forget what\Nyou were thinking about, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what happens if you keep\Nthinking those blasphemous thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.30,0:13:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pain gets worse and worse until\Nit's searing your brain, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.78,0:13:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your vision turns red, and\Nyour right eye explodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.16,0:13:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, did your eye...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.30,0:13:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To put a stop to Administrator's rule,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:13:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew I would be confronting\NChudelkin as well as her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.32,0:14:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To muster the resolve to do\Nso, I had to lose my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.94,0:14:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I recall\NAdministrator saying something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.14,0:14:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something about the seal of the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.36,0:14:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe she said, code...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.50,0:14:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.76,0:14:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Code 871!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.28,0:14:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She looked right at me, and that is what\Nshe called the seal of the right eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.60,0:14:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe she also said it was installed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.58,0:14:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did not know what she meant at the\Ntime, but could this code 871 seal?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.64,0:14:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be a product of the real world, a seal\N871—it must be an inhibitor, but why.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.34,0:14:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would Rath install that in them in\Nthe end it would just get in the way
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.22,0:14:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rath's ultimate goal was to make an AI\Nwith true intelligence. The underworld
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.06,0:14:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was created for that purpose and that's\Nwhy Ki-Kuoka and Hika let it evolve
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.44,0:14:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for centuries internally if the whole\Npoint of this simulation was to give the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.58,0:15:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AIs the opportunity to demonstrate free\Nwill forcing them into obedience with
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.36,0:15:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an inhibitor defeats the purpose unless
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.88,0:15:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the seal is a kind of sabotage are the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.84,0:15:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,people in the ocean turtles main con\Nbehind this no saboteur must be someone
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.60,0:15:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with wrath they could be with us in\Nsubcon i have to tell kikwoka but there's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.34,0:15:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no terminal here i could suicide out but\Ni need alice to save kirito what do i do
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.00,0:15:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.76,0:15:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.52,0:15:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.72,0:15:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Code 871 seal was\Nput there by someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone from my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.08,0:15:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they're on the enemy's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.66,0:15:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we get rid of the seal?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there a way to do it without\Nblowing out someone's eyeball?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.10,0:15:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I don't know of another way\Nto disable it from inside the Underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, based on what\Nwe know about this enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.86,0:16:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they only want someone who's got the\Nwillpower to break the seal of the right eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.02,0:16:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.14,0:16:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do all the folks in your\Nworld have a seal like we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.14,0:16:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's something\Nwe've never had to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.10,0:16:15.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.01,0:16:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe the only point of difference\Nbetween the Underworld and the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.62,0:16:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,real-worlders is how you're being\Nforced to obey your laws and orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.16,0:16:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever's responsible for the seal in your\Neye doesn't want you having free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.00,0:16:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're afraid of this priestess\Nof light, as you call her,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.52,0:16:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because someone like that could\Nruin whatever they had planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.90,0:16:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if she appeared in my world,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.02,0:16:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your priestess of light would be\Nconsidered extremely valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still don't get what the fuss is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said so yourself just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.66,0:16:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There ain't a whole lot of\Ndifference between our kinds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.02,0:16:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing is a seal of the\Nright eye, except for Alice here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.12,0:16:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She broke her seal, and according to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.44,0:16:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's no different than\Na real-worlder now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.72,0:17:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got a world full of your kind already,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.44,0:17:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so why are you and your enemies so\Nobsessed with snatching up little Alice?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.88,0:17:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once you do get her in your world,\Nwhat are you planning on doing with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.92,0:17:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.83,0:17:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.90,0:17:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.46,0:17:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She should see the real world first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.82,0:17:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then she can decide what\Nshe wants to do for herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.84,0:17:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no paradise either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.98,0:17:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.18,0:17:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compared to here, it's not as tranquil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.16,0:17:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not as pretty or as clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.90,0:17:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, there are good\Nthings about my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.86,0:17:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people, for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.42,0:17:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's some who'd want to exploit you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's more who'd\Nwant to protect this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.44,0:17:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.26,0:17:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have questions, but\Nthey can wait until later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.90,0:17:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, we must focus on\Nbreaking the enemy army.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.02,0:17:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then we must make peace\Nwith the Dark Territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.12,0:17:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not go anywhere until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.04,0:17:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.10,0:17:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.01,0:18:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now that we know Vecta's\Nfrom the real world,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.02,0:18:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'd be dangerous for us to\Nleave the safety of your army.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.12,0:18:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be expecting that, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.22,0:18:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, I'll join\Nyour people in the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for Vecta, let me\Ndeal with him. All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're glad to have you along.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.08,0:18:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About your skill, how you split\Nthe ground open like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.44,0:18:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there a limit to using it? There is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.40,0:18:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can alter the landscape like\Nthat one or two more times.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.36,0:18:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our world, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.12,0:18:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protecting it is our\Nresponsibility, not hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.12,0:18:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us show her what we are capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.90,0:18:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, you are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.78,0:18:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Asuna is not a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.46,0:18:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She just told us she was human\Nlike the rest of us if she
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is willing to fight hard Then\Nwe shall fight even harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.12,0:18:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I support this. If only to fight\Nthat pugilist again. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.82,0:18:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our world. It's\Nour duty to protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.22,0:18:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll protect this\Nworld, Kitty doll up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.00,0:19:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the hijackers aboard the ocean\Nturtle and from wrath if I have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.46,0:19:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you would come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will let you see him, and I will\Ntell you everything I know of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.20,0:19:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In return, however, if you are agreeable,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.24,0:19:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must tell me\Neverything you know of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.14,0:19:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a deal, but we go back a\Nlong way, so there's a lot to tell
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.96,0:19:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how long were you and\Nhe together? Let's see,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.74,0:19:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was his partner in battle for two years,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then we dated properly\Nfor a year and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for two weeks, we even lived together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.20,0:19:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.56,0:19:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I fought by his side for one\Nnight. But for the past six months,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.50,0:20:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have lived with him\Nand taken care of him
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really? That long?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.50,0:20:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.40,0:20:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, he was my mentor and I\Ncleaned his room for two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.16,0:20:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I also learned sword skills from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.76,0:20:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He also brought me honey pies\Nfrom the Prancing Beer Café.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.78,0:20:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I didn't spend as much\Ntime with him as either of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.04,0:20:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'd like to swap stories with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.72,0:20:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, you're more than welcome\Nto join us if you want, Rolier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me for intruding, but would you\Nhave room for one more in your group?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.08,0:20:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there, I saw you at the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.72,0:20:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am an Imperial Knight of Norlingarth,\Nand my name is Sword Alne Surlute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.82,0:20:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was going to wait until\Nafter the battle to see him,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.08,0:20:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but since Kirito and I\Nshare a bit of history,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.06,0:20:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was most eager to see how he was faring.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.26,0:20:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understandable, Chief Guard, Sir Lute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.96,0:20:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you know, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.44,0:21:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may call me Lina if it\Npleases you, Lady Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.00,0:21:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito is a primary trainee at the\NNorth Senator Swordcraft Academy,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.02,0:21:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where I too was studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.70,0:21:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For one year, he served as my page.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.42,0:21:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We trained together, and in so doing,\NI taught him some of my sword skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.68,0:21:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, it already sounds like\Nyou'll have tons of neat stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.10,0:21:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the club, Lina.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.46,0:21:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.16,0:21:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back where we come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.28,0:21:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's called Dual Wielding, Kirito. Really?
